## Honest description of what you are getting

These labels are **model output, not human ground truth**, and they were
produced by a generator running outside its calibration regime. The full
provenance audit is in `../audit/REPORT.md`; the measured quality caveats
(blob merging in `gold113`, dropped inference tiles, non-binary thresholds) are
in `../benchmark/README.md`. Use them as a benchmark of *agreement with the
current public state of the art*, not as truth.
